{"ID":"20240118151125-gxkjiyy","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151125-gxkjiyy","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151125-gxkjiyy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151125-swcnr1q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122131850-686e6w7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122131850-686e6w7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:96,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:96\u0026#125;","title":"197马先蒿198积雪草199女菀200王孙","type":"doc","updated":"20240201133651"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151125-swcnr1q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151125-swcnr1q","updated":"20240122131813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"马先蒿"}]},{"ID":"20240122131813-rmvggcl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131813-rmvggcl","updated":"20240122131817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，平，无毒。治寒热，鬼疰，中风，湿痹；女子带下病，无子。生川泽，一名马屎蒿。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131817-i0peq5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131817-i0peq5q","updated":"20240122131820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"积雪草"}]},{"ID":"20240122131823-szf7uy2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131823-szf7uy2","updated":"20240122131825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，寒，无毒。治大热，恶疮，痈疽，浸淫，赤熛，皮肤赤，身热。生川谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131826-qd9rbhf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131826-qd9rbhf","updated":"20240122131829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"女菀"}]},{"ID":"20240122131829-mlkjb2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131829-mlkjb2y","updated":"20240122131834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，温，无毒。治风寒洒洒，霍乱，泻利，肠鸣上下无常处，惊痫，寒热，百疾。生川谷或山阳。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131835-rfhodvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131835-rfhodvx","updated":"20240122131843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"王孙"}]},{"ID":"20240122131843-grc9op7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131843-grc9op7","updated":"20240122131849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，平，无毒。治五脏邪气，寒湿痹，四肢疼酸，膝冷痛。生川谷及城郭垣下。吴名白功草。楚名王孙，齐名长孙。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131847-0y9bpue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131847-0y9bpue"}},{"ID":"20240122131850-kv1pk3x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131850-kv1pk3x"}},{"ID":"20240122131850-686e6w7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131850-686e6w7","updated":"20240201133651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"197，198，199，200哦，这些药呢，哦，很少使用。而且现在认得的人也不多。象那第23个积雪草，都住在深山山顶上，都很难找到的。你们诸位看到《神农本草经》有这些药，以后你们去找，这些药药房都买不到的。你自己去看。那我们还是留在那边，因为本草经有它的记载。"}]}]}